<title>USA: FNB Financial sets 33-1/3 pct stock payout.</title>
<headline>FNB Financial sets 33-1/3 pct stock payout.</headline>
<dateline>REIDSVILLE, N.C. 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>FNB Financial Services Corp said Friday it declared a 33-1/3 percent stock dividend, payable April 30 to shareholders of record April 23.</p>
<p>The company said the dividend is the second stock dividend in the past 13 months.</p>
<p>The dividend will be paid in the form of one share of stock for every three shares owned on the record date, the company said.</p>
